<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seek4Job – Help Center & Contact Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="CSS/style.css">
</head>

<body class="nav-body">

        <!-- 🔹 NAVIGATION BAR -->
        <nav class="top-nav">
            <div class="left-area">
            <img src="images/logo.png" alt="Logo" class="logo-img">
            </div>

            <ul class="center-menu">
      		<li><a href="employer_aboutus.html">About Us</a></li>
      		<li><a href="#" class="active">Dashboard</a></li>
     		<li><a href="employer_profile.html">Profile</a></li>
            </ul>

            <button class="name-btn" id="nameBtn">Name</button>
        </nav>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- PAGE TITLE -->
            <header class="page-header">
                <h1>Help Center</h1>
                <p>Your support hub for FAQs, guides, and assistance for both Job Seekers and Employers.</p>
            </header>

         <!-- GENERAL FAQs -->
            <section class="generalfaqs-section">
                <h2 class="generalfaqs-title">General Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

                <div class="generalfaqs">
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>I forgot my password. How can I reset it?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Click “Forgot Password” on the login page and follow the instructions to reset your password via email.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I update my profile information?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Go to your account settings/profile page to edit your personal information, skills, and preferences.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I contact Seek4Job support?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Use the “Contact Us” form on the Help Center page or email support@seek4job.org for assistance.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>Is my data safe on Seek4Job?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes. We use secure encryption and follow privacy standards to protect all user data.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </section>

              

        <!-- HELP CENTER SECTION -->
            <section class="help-center-section">
                <div class="help-center">
        <!-- JOB SEEKER FAQs -->
            <h2 class="help-center-jobseeker-title">FAQs for Job Seekers</h2>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I create a Seek4Job profile?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Go to “Sign Up”, enter your details, verify your email, and complete your profile sections such as skills, education, and experience.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I apply for a job?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>After completing your profile, browse job listings and click “Apply”. You may need to upload a resume if required by the employer.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>Why am I not getting job matches?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Ensure your profile is fully complete and update your skills, preferred industries, and job filters for better matching accuracy.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>

            
            <div class="help-center">
        <!-- EMPLOYER FAQs -->
            <h2 class="help-center-employer-title">FAQs for Employers</h2>
        
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I post a job listing?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Go to your employer dashboard and click “Create Job Listing”. Fill in the role requirements and publish the listing.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I view candidate applications?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Applications appear in your dashboard under “Manage Applicants”. You can filter, shortlist, or contact candidates directly.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <h3>How do I verify employer status?</h3>
                            <span class="icon">+</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Upload your company registration documents under “Business Verification”. Approval takes 1–2 business days.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </section>
            


        <!-- CONTACT US -->
            <section class="contact-section">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you need personal assistance, you can reach us via the following:</p>

                <div class="contact-info">
                    <p><strong>Phone: </strong>&nbsp; +60 12-345 6789</p>
                    <p><strong>Email: </strong>&nbsp; <a href="mailto:support@seek4job.org">support@seek4job.org</a></p>
                    <p><strong>Address: </strong>&nbsp; Taylor's University Lakeside Campus, 1, Jln Taylors, 47500 Subang Jaya, Selangor</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- 🔹 FOOTER -->
             <footer class="site-footer">
            <div class="footer-center">
            <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="employer_helpcenter-contactus.html">Help Center & Contact Us</a>
        <a href="employer_feedback-reportissues.html">Feedback & Report Issue</a>
            </div>
            <p>&copy 2025 Seek4Job. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>

            <a href="index.html" class="logout-btn">Logout</a>
        </footer>

    <script src="JS/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
